  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are a particularly religious cat and carry a holy symbol in your fur patterns.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Dreamlands cat, must worship a deity or follow a faith that has a holy or unholy symbol.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You manifest a pattern in your fur on an obvious part of your body that resembles the holy (or unholy) symbol of your faith. You can use this symbol as a divine focus when spellcasting or using other abilities that require you to present the symbol.</p>\n<p>A number of times per day equal to your Dexterity modifier (minimum of once per day), this symbol in your fur allows you to cast a spell with a somatic component normally as if you had hands, rather than taking an extra move action to cast the spell.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythos-feats#toc3\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
